{"When `enable_advanced_features=True` and `cursor.offset < 0`, line 882 executes `queryset[start_offset:stop]` with a negative `start_offset`. Django QuerySets do not support negative indexing and will raise `AssertionError: Negative indexing is not supported.` The comment on line 876 claiming the ORM handles this automatically is incorrect.": 0.9742790460586548, "Accessing `organization_context.member.has_global_access` at line 71 throws `AttributeError` when `organization_context.member` is `None`, which happens when the user has no membership with the organization. The code should defensively check for `None` before accessing the attribute.": 0.6769787073135376}